{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:07 2026-10-29 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:07 2026-10-29 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:07 2026-10-29 HKT</p><img alt=\"資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/845e74340685eb5edc70f7b9279fc9b4/2026-10/page_259.jpg\"/><p>香港仔發生工業意外。今日（29日）早上10時16分，警方接獲報案，指石排灣道100A號一艘吊船於工作期間，撞向大廈外牆，兩名工人受傷。其中男工人暈倒，女工人則後腦受傷。救援人員趕到，發現62歲姓歐男工陷入半昏迷，而57歲盧女工則清醒，遂將2人送往瑪麗醫院救治。警方正調查事件。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:22:01.498844+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T03:07:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T03:18:30.292805+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T03:18:30.292805+00:00","content_hash":"e5014e968ae266f3b44770f39726fa805934dff7cb9d1a1c4b3f417a0a8e80a7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}